cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PF-Feedforward-EAST: imitation learning for feedforward coil current trajectory design on EAST"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lu
    given-names: Jingjing
repository-code: "https://github.com/TokFusionAI/PF_Feedforward_EAST"
url: "https://github.com/TokFusionAI/PF_Feedforward_EAST"
abstract: >-
  Behavioral-cloning pipeline that maps a prescribed EAST plasma-boundary
  evolution to the 12 independent pre-programmed PF coil-current
  trajectories, with operational-constraint filtering and free-boundary
  Grad-Shafranov (FreeGSNKE) equilibrium validation.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - EAST
  - poloidal field coils
  - feedforward current design
  - imitation learning
  - behavioral cloning
  - transformer
  - plasma shape control
  - FreeGSNKE
  - tokamak
